'''Wolf Tooth''' is an {{Uncommon}} Crafting Material obtained by killing the [[Sven Packmaster]]. It is a {{Odds|guaranteed}} drop.
Many high level items are crafted with [[Golden Tooth|Golden Teeth]], which must themselves be crafted with Wolf Teeth.

== Obtaining ==
=== Sven Packmaster ===
'''Wolf Teeth''' can be obtained from any tier of [[Sven Packmaster]]:
*{{Stier|I}}: {{Item|Wolf Tooth|amount=1-3}}
*{{Stier|II}}: {{Item|Wolf Tooth|amount=9-18}}
*{{Stier|III}}: {{Item|Wolf Tooth|amount=30-50}}
*{{Stier|IV}}: {{Item|Wolf Tooth|amount=50-64}}

